Task:
Create advanced log analysis and alerting system.
What to Do:
●    Create Lambda function that generates various log types:
●    INFO: Successful operations
●    WARN: Slow operations (>500ms)
●    ERROR: Failed operations with error codes
●    Run function 100 times with random outcomes
●    Create CloudWatch Logs Insights queries to find:
●    Error rate per minute
●    Average response time
●    Top 5 error codes
●    Failed requests by user_id
●    Create metric filter to extract custom metrics:
●    Count of 500 errors
●    Count of slow requests
●    Extract response time as metric
●    Create CloudWatch alarm that triggers when:
●    Error rate > 5% in 5 minutes
●    Average response time > 1000ms
●    Send alarm to SNS → your email
Success Criteria:
●    Insights queries return correct results
●    Alarms trigger when thresholds breached
●    Custom metrics appear in CloudWatch